Leading/trailing whitespace in cells is trimmed.

```
|  a  | \  | \\ |
.
<table>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
<td>\</td>
</tr>
</table>
```

regression test: bug caused consecutive table to disappear

```
|a|

|b|
.
<table>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
</tr>
</table>
<table>
<tr>
<td>b</td>
</tr>
</table>
```

Separator line may not contain other characters

```
|:--------------.|
|a|
.
<table>
<tr>
<td>:–––––––.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
</tr>
</table>
```


```
|:--------------.:|
|a|
.
<table>
<tr>
<td>:–––––––.:</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
</tr>
</table>
```

Tables can be interrupted if end pipe is escaped

```
|a|
|b\|
.
<table>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>|b|</p>
```

```
| ``` `` ``` |
.
<table>
<tr>
<td><code>``</code></td>
</tr>
</table>
```

```
|a|b|
^ a
  b
  c
.
<table>
<caption>a
b
c</caption>
<tr>
<td>a</td>
<td>b</td>
</tr>
</table>
```
